      ],
      "content": "1. 839                                          HIGH STREET                                              (South Side)                                              No 189                                              (Barclays Bank Limited)                                              (Formerly listed as                                               Sydney House) SP 99()7 NW 1/33      29.7.50.               II 2.  Early C18.  Red and blue grey chequered brickwork with red stretchers, blue grey headers.  2 storeys, tiled roof gabled at west end, dentil eaves cornice. 3 flush sashes, 3 light either side of single light, cutter flat arches. Central doorway: Doric pilasters, under entablatures with triglyphs and guttae, pediment, panelled reveal to door and oblong fanlight.  Bank name in Roman lettering under 1st floor window sills. Modern imitation wing on right; 2 windows with similar doorway.  Back wing on left extends up King Road. Listing NGR: SP9908507847"
    }
